# Bug Briefs

- Viven en `memory/bugs/`.
- IDs `BUG-YYYYMMDD-SEQ`. Status: `Ready for Fix`.
- Sincronizar `_index.json` y `memory/backlog.json`.
- Feature disfrazada de bug → Director → Discovery.
